		</title>
	</calculatedField>
	<calculatedField>
		<dataPath>AnalyticsCostsAdditional</dataPath>
		<expression>Case 
When CostKind = &amp;Material_ Or CostKind = &amp;Services Then Series
When CostKind = &amp;LaborCosts Then Undefined
When CostKind = &amp;Itemized Then Undefined
